  "id": "def-sfb-qlbar-coefficient-ring",
  "kind": "definition",
  "title": "The coefficient ring $\\overline{\\mathbf Q}_{\\ell,X}$",
  "statement": "Let $\\ell$ be a prime and let $\\underline{\\Qlb}$ be the condensed ring of\n[sk-def-sfb-qlbar-condensed]. For a scheme $X$, put\n$\\overline{\\mathbf Q}_{\\ell,X}:=p_X^*\\underline{\\Qlb}$. By\n[sk-def-sfb-pulled-back-coefficients], this is a commutative ring object of\n$\\Sh(X_{\\mathrm{proét}},\\Ab)$.",
